@title DWG import without a converter, and a wrong converter program, are job flags with a popover
@area Files
# T12: no DWG converter is installed on the test machine; choosing a file that is not a converter is refused. Both are the same job flag (import.dwg), newest text shown in the popover with Retry-less buttons Open folder, Copy details, Dismiss.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/files/fake.dwg
key ctrl+k
text import dwg
wait 5
key Enter
wait 15
expect "No DWG converter"
shot dwg-no-converter-flag
check_layout
click_text "No DWG converter" Button
wait 8
expect "Dismiss"
shot dwg-no-converter-popover
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/files/not-a-drawing.dxf
key ctrl+k
text choose dwg converter
wait 5
key Enter
wait 15
expect "Not a DWG converter"
click_text "Not a DWG converter" Button
wait 8
shot dwg-wrong-converter-popover
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
